{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Shopify customer testimonial section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT REQUIREMENT: Follow the reference image exactly. Do not redesign, change the card arrangement, introduce additional elements, or create a generic review section.
    
    1. SECTION STRUCTURE
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Background: pure white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Vertical padding: 65px.
    
    Minimal, clean, premium editorial design.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    2. TOP HEADER
    
    Create a left-aligned header at the top.
    
    Eyebrow:
    "— LOVED BY PARENTS"
    
    Montserrat Medium.
    
    9px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Main heading:
    "Little Ones Approve."
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    Font size: 36px desktop.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Line height: 1.2.
    
    Margin below: 22px.
    
    3. NAVIGATION ARROWS
    
    Position two circular navigation buttons at the top-right, aligned horizontally with the heading.
    
    Previous button:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin light-grey border.
    
    Left arrow icon.
    
    Dark olive icon.
    
    Next button:
    
    Dark olive background (#626B4C).
    
    White right arrow icon.
    
    Specifications:
    
    46px × 46px.
    
    Perfect circular shape.
    
    12px gap.
    
    Smooth hover transition.
    
    Functional previous/next navigation.
    
    4. TESTIMONIAL CARDS
    
    Create exactly THREE testimonial cards visible side by side on desktop.
    
    Layout:
    
    Three equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 18px.
    
    Each card approximately 360px wide and 230px tall.
    
    Background: warm cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Border radius: 17px.
    
    Padding: 26px.
    
    No heavy borders.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    All three cards must have identical dimensions and internal layout., CARD 1
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Five small mustard-yellow stars.
    
    Colour: #E7AE2E.
    
    Font size: 14px.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Review:
    "The softest thing my daughter owns. She naps so much better in these, and they still feel brand new after plenty of washes."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Ananya R.
    Product: Snugly Footies
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "AR".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    CARD 2
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Review:
    "Bought the full-sleeve bodysuits for the cooler months and they're perfect — cosy but never sweaty. Lovely stretch, easy to dress."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Meera K.
    Product: Luxurious Bodysuits
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "MK".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    CARD 3
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Review:
    "Free delivery and cash on delivery made it easy to try. The romper is so soft it's now my go-to gift for every baby shower."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Priya S.
    Product: Cosy Rompers
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "PS".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    5. CARD INTERNAL ALIGNMENT
    
    Every testimonial card must follow this exact vertical structure:
    
    Five-star rating at the top-left.
    
    Customer review below the rating.
    
    Thin subtle horizontal divider near the bottom.
    
    Customer avatar and information at the bottom-left.
    
    Small product thumbnail at the bottom-right.
    
    Review typography:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    13px desktop.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Line height: 1.55.
    
    Maximum width: 100%., Customer name:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    11px.
    
    Dark olive.
    
    Product name:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    9px.
    
    Muted grey olive.
    
    6. SLIDER PAGINATION
    
    Position pagination indicators centrally underneath the three cards.
    
    Three small circular indicators.
    
    Active indicator: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Inactive indicators: light beige-grey (#D9D9CD).
    
    Active indicator should be a short horizontal pill rather than a circle.
    
    Approximately 7px high.
    
    Gap: 8px.
    
    Margin-top: 28px.
    
    The pagination must update when the customer navigates between testimonial slides.
    
    7. COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following exact palette:
    
    Section background: #FFFFFF
    
    Card background: #F5F3E7
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Review text: #555849
    
    Star yellow: #E7AE2E
    
    Divider: #E5E3D7
    
    Inactive pagination: #D9D9CD
    
    8. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Main heading: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Eyebrow: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Reviews: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Customer names: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Product names: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Maintain a clean, sophisticated typography hierarchy.
    
    9. FUNCTIONAL SHOPIFY SLIDER
    
    This section must be functional, not just a static design.
    
    Display three testimonial cards simultaneously on desktop.
    
    Implement horizontal carousel functionality.
    
    Previous and next buttons must work.
    
    Pagination indicators must be clickable.
    
    Support touch/swipe navigation on mobile.
    
    Use smooth horizontal sliding.
    
    Avoid autoplay unless enabled through a section setting.
    
    Make the number of visible cards responsive.
    
    10. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    
    Three cards in one horizontal row.
    
    Header on top.
    
    Navigation arrows aligned top-right.
    
    Pagination centred below.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Display two cards at a time.
    
    Maintain consistent card proportions.
    
    Functional slider navigation.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Display one testimonial card at a time.
    
    Full-width card with 20px side margins.
    
    Heading approximately 27px.
    
    Review text approximately 13px.
    
    Navigation must remain accessible.
    
    Pagination centred underneath.
    
    Prevent horizontal page overflow.
    
    11. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Provide editable settings for:
    
    Eyebrow text.
    
    Main heading.
    
    Section background colour.
    
    Card background colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Star colour.
    
    Customer review text.
    
    Customer name.
    
    Product name.
    
    Customer initials.
    
    Customer avatar image (optional).
    
    Product thumbnail image.
    
    Star rating.
    
    Navigation arrows.
    
    Pagination style.
    
    Cards visible per device.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Card border radius.
    
    Autoplay toggle.
    
    Use Shopify blocks for individual testimonials so the merchant can add, edit, remove, and reorder reviews directly from the theme editor.
    
    Use image_picker settings for customer and product images.
    
    Use inline SVG for navigation arrows and CSS or SVG for star icons.
    
    Use semantic HTML, clean CSS and lightweight JavaScript.
    
    Ensure compatibility with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not modify existing theme sections.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.section_background }};font-family:Montserrat,{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif;color:#626b4c}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:{{ block.settings.vertical_padding }}px 55px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 10px;color:#777D5D;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1.4;text-transform:uppercase}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:flex;gap:12px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{width:46px;height:46px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;border:1px solid #deded8;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#626B4C;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .2s,color .2s}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--next{background:#626B4C;color:#fff;border-color:#626B4C}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:hover{background:#4c543a;color:#fff}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible,.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #343a29;outline-offset:3px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button svg{width:17px;height:17px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{overflow:hidden;touch-action:pan-y}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;transition:transform 350ms ease;will-change:transform}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);height:230px;min-width:0;padding:26px;border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;background:{{ block.settings.card_background }};display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars{margin:0 0 11px;color:{{ block.settings.star_color }};font-size:14px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:2px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.review_color }};font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:400}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #E5E3D7;min-height:48px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__avatar{width:34px;height:34px;flex:0 0 34px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;background:#626B4C;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:600}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details{min-width:0}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name{margin:0;color:#343a29;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product{margin:2px 0 0;color:#777D5D;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb{width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px;margin-left:auto;overflow:hidden;border-radius:6px;background:#e8e5d8}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb img,.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:28px}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot{width:7px;height:7px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#D9D9CD;cursor:pointer;transition:width .2s,background-color .2s}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot[aria-current="true"]{width:22px;background:#626B4C}
  @media(max-width:989px){.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}
  @media(max-width:749px){.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{padding:{{ block.settings.vertical_padding | divided_by: 2 }}px 20px}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{align-items:center}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font-size:27px}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{gap:8px}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{width:40px;height:40px}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{gap:12px}.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:100%;height:230px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track,.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button,.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<testimonial-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}" data-interval="{{ block.settings.autoplay_interval }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <header class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><div><p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2></div><div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav"><button type="button" class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--prev" aria-label="Previous testimonials"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m0 0 7-7m-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--next" aria-label="Next testimonials"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m0 0-7-7m7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></header>
    <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport" aria-label="Customer testimonials"><div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">
      {% for i in (1..3) %}
        {% liquid
          assign q = 'quote_' | append: i
          assign n = 'name_' | append: i
          assign initials = 'initials_' | append: i
          assign prod = 'product_name_' | append: i
          assign avatar = 'avatar_' | append: i
          assign image = 'product_image_' | append: i
          assign rating_id = 'rating_' | append: i
          assign rating = block.settings[rating_id]
          assign quote = block.settings[q]
          assign name = block.settings[n]
          assign initials_value = block.settings[initials]
          assign product_name = block.settings[prod]
          assign avatar_image = block.settings[avatar]
          assign product_image = block.settings[image]
        %}
        <article class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars" aria-label="{{ rating }} out of 5 stars">{% for star in (1..5) %}{% if star <= rating %}★{% else %}☆{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p><p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote">“{{ quote | escape }}”</p><div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer">{% if avatar_image %}<img class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__avatar" src="{{ avatar_image | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34">{% else %}<span class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ initials_value | escape }}</span>{% endif %}<div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details"><p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name">{{ name | escape }}</p><p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product">{{ product_name | escape }}</p></div><div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb">{% if product_image %}<img src="{{ product_image | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="{{ product_name | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="38" height="38">{% else %}{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}</div></div></article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div></div>
    <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots" role="group" aria-label="Choose testimonial slide">{% for i in (1..3) %}<button type="button" class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot" aria-label="Go to testimonial {{ i }}" aria-current="{% if i == 1 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}"></button>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
</testimonial-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>
(()=>{const tag='testimonial-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class ReviewSlider extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');this.viewport=this.querySelector('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport');this.cards=[...this.querySelectorAll('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card')];this.dots=[...this.querySelectorAll('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot')];this.index=0;this.startX=0;this.querySelector('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--prev').addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.querySelector('.ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--next').addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));this.dots.forEach((dot,i)=>dot.addEventListener('click',()=>this.go(i)));this.viewport.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{this.startX=e.changedTouches[0].clientX},{passive:true});this.viewport.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{const delta=this.startX-e.changedTouches[0].clientX;if(Math.abs(delta)>40)this.move(delta>0?1:-1)},{passive:true});this.onResize=()=>this.render();window.addEventListener('resize',this.onResize);if(this.dataset.autoplay==='true'&&!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches){this.timer=setInterval(()=>this.move(1),Number(this.dataset.interval)||5000);this.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>clearInterval(this.timer));this.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{this.timer=setInterval(()=>this.move(1),Number(this.dataset.interval)||5000)})}this.render()}disconnectedCallback(){window.removeEventListener('resize',this.onResize);clearInterval(this.timer)}visible(){return innerWidth<=749?1:innerWidth<=989?2:3}maxIndex(){return Math.max(0,this.cards.length-this.visible())}move(step){this.go(this.index+step)}go(i){const max=this.maxIndex();this.index=i<0?max:i>max?0:i;this.render()}render(){if(!this.cards.length)return;const gap=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap)||0;const cardWidth=this.cards[0].getBoundingClientRect().width;this.track.style.transform=`translateX(-${this.index*(cardWidth+gap)}px)`;this.dots.forEach((dot,i)=>{dot.setAttribute('aria-current',String(i===this.index));dot.hidden=i>this.maxIndex()})}}customElements.define(tag,ReviewSlider)})();
</script>
